# Outline Edits (`outline.md` & `_OUTLINE.md`)

Applies to: `series/architectures-of-memory/book-*/outline.md` and `series/parenthood-atlas/chapters/_OUTLINE.md`

- Treat outline changes as **architecture**: open a Linear issue with label **`structure`** under Team `ARC` before large edits; link the PR.
- Preserve **part** and **chapter** numbering intent; if you renumber, update cross-references in `chapters/`, `evidence-cards/`, `research/notes/`, and `research/fact-checks/`.
- **Epigraphs and key arguments** must stay aligned with [`COMPOSITION.md`](../../COMPOSITION.md) and the series bible ([`series/architectures-of-memory/series-bible.md`](../../series/architectures-of-memory/series-bible.md) or [`series/parenthood-atlas/COMPOSITION.md`](../../series/parenthood-atlas/COMPOSITION.md)).
